---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Independent games, mods, and experiments" description="An independent studio creating thoughtful mods, games, and interactive experiments.">
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Independent developer · Mods · Games</p>
      <h1>Small teams.<br /><span>Big ideas.</span></h1>
      <p class="intro">A home for curious experiments, game worlds, and mods built with care. Practical ideas, a little weirdness, and projects made to be played.</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button primary" href="#projects">Explore projects <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
        <a class="button" href="https://github.com/AVIX-afk" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Browse GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Abstract studio graphic" role="img">
      <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
      <div class="art-core"><span>✳</span><small>MAKE<br />SOMETHING</small></div>
      <span class="art-label label-one">MODS / 01</span>
      <span class="art-label label-two">GAMES / NEXT</span>
      <span class="art-dot"></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects" class="section container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p><h2>Projects with a pulse.</h2></div>
      <p class="muted section-note">One project at a time. More worlds in progress.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="project-card card" href="/projects/minecraft-cannabis/">
      <div class="project-art">
        <div class="pixel-plant"><span></span><i></i><b></b><em></em></div>
        <span class="art-caption">FABRIC MOD · JAVA EDITION</span>
        <span class="number">01</span>
      </div>
      <div class="project-info">
        <div class="project-meta"><span class="status"><i></i> Published project</span><span class="muted">Minecraft · Modding</span></div>
        <h3>Minecraft Cannabis</h3>
        <p class="muted">A vanilla-style farming and crafting mod with twelve strains, cross-breeding, custom tools, and a whole lot of discovery.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Explore project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <div class="future-note"><span class="plus">＋</span><span><strong>More projects will land here.</strong><br /><span class="muted">Future games, tools, and experiments—when they are ready to share.</span></span></div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="section container about">
    <p class="eyebrow">The approach</p>
    <h2>Make it useful.<br />Make it memorable.<br /><span>Keep it human.</span></h2>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="muted">This is an independent home for projects that start with curiosity and grow through iteration. The goal is not a giant studio machine—it is a growing shelf of finished, playable ideas.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/AVIX-afk" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Follow the work on GitHub ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero { min-height: 570px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr; align-items: center; gap: 44px; padding-top: 76px; padding-bottom: 66px; }
  .hero h1 { margin: 20px 0 22px; }
  .hero h1 span, .about h2 span { color: var(--accent); }
  .intro { max-width: 540px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .hero-art { position: relative; min-height: 380px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 45%, #30472f 0, #1c2b20 36%, #141a16 72%); }
  .orbit { position: absolute; width: 310px; height: 310px; border: 1px solid #b9f28c38; border-radius: 50%; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); }
  .orbit-one { width: 240px; height: 340px; transform: translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(35deg); }
  .orbit-two { width: 340px; height: 240px; transform: translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-35deg); }
  .art-core { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); display: grid; place-items: center; gap: 8px; width: 138px; height: 138px; border-radius: 34px; background: var(--accent); color: #152017; box-shadow: 0 0 90px #b9f28c35; rotate: -8deg; }
  .art-core span { font-size: 3rem; line-height: 1; }
  .art-core small { font-size: .57rem; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .13em; text-align: center; }
  .art-label { position: absolute; font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .14em; color: #d8e7d4; }
  .label-one { top: 28px; left: 26px; }.label-two { right: 24px; bottom: 26px; }
  .art-dot { position: absolute; top: 24%; right: 22%; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--accent); }
  .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 25px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .section-heading h2 { margin-bottom: 0; }.section-note { max-width: 250px; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: .9rem; }
  .project-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s; }
  .project-card:hover { border-color: #5e775e; transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .project-art { position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 340px; overflow: hidden; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 65%, #4c7440 0, #263b2b 30%, #18221b 70%); }
  .project-art::before, .project-art::after { content: ""; position: absolute; width: 260px; height: 260px; border: 1px solid #b9f28c20; border-radius: 50%; }
  .project-art::after { width: 330px; height: 330px; }
  .pixel-plant { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 15px; height: 132px; background: #a0d56c; box-shadow: -15px 20px 0 #5c9a50, 15px 42px 0 #78b85b, 0 68px 0 #6caa50; transform: rotate(8deg); }
  .pixel-plant span, .pixel-plant i, .pixel-plant b, .pixel-plant em { position: absolute; display: block; width: 58px; height: 20px; background: #8bcf69; }
  .pixel-plant span { left: -48px; top: 25px; transform: rotate(25deg); }.pixel-plant i { left: 6px; top: 45px; transform: rotate(-35deg); background: #559b51; }
  .pixel-plant b { left: -35px; top: 75px; transform: rotate(25deg); background: #6db65a; }.pixel-plant em { left: 4px; top: 92px; transform: rotate(-28deg); background: #91d66d; }
  .art-caption { position: absolute; left: 23px; bottom: 22px; color: #d0e2cb; font-size: .63rem; letter-spacing: .13em; }
  .number { position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 22px; color: #d0e2cb88; font-size: .78rem; }
  .project-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px); }
  .project-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center; font-size: .76rem; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .status { display: inline-flex; gap: 7px; align-items: center; padding: 5px 9px; border: 1px solid #405640; border-radius: 999px; color: var(--accent); }
  .status i { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); }
  .project-info h3 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); letter-spacing: -.045em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .project-info p { max-width: 420px; }
  .text-link { display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; color: var(--accent); font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 750; }
  .future-note { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 17px; padding: 25px 0; margin-top: 14px; font-size: .9rem; }
  .plus { display: grid; place-items: center; flex: 0 0 40px; height: 40px; border: 1px dashed #536553; border-radius: 13px; color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .7fr 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; align-items: start; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 45px; }
  .about h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .about-copy { padding-top: 7px; }.about-copy p { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 60px; gap: 32px; }.hero-art { min-height: 300px; }.project-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.project-art { min-height: 270px; }.section-heading { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }.section-note { margin: 0; }.about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }.about-copy { max-width: 550px; } }
</style>
